// Core-issued DMA control packets using the query worker binding table.
// Each table slot holds a 64-bit device base installed by cohort preparation.
// The byte-offset argument is added with carry; descriptor updates precede
// receiver/sender queue publication. Names identify the binding slot and shim
// descriptor. The caller retains storage ownership until control completion.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.core

